      // closed yet, but a fresh row's sparkline should not be empty either. The
      // rest of the array is grown, one sample per bucket close, by
      // {@link advanceHistoryWindow} — never here, or a change landing mid-bucket
      // would be recorded twice.
      if (this.#historyWindow) this.#historyBuckets.set(key, [value]);
      this.#streaks.set(key, 0);
