  /**
   * Is this column hidden from the user entirely?
   *
   * Only `hidden`. A `writeOnly` column is *present* — it has to be, or there is
   * nowhere to enter the new secret — so ask {@link isReadable} rather than this
   * one at any call site that is about a value rather than a column.
   * @param {string|object} colOrId the column id, or the resolved column
   * @returns {boolean} true when the level is `hidden`
   */
  isHidden(colOrId) { return !CAN_SEE[this.levelOf(colOrId)]; }

  /**
   * May this column be shown at all? The inverse of {@link isHidden}, spelled
   * positively for the call sites that read better that way.
   * @param {string|object} colOrId the column id, or the resolved column
   * @returns {boolean} true when the column may be displayed
   */
