/**
 * Status bar — §18.5 "status bar (composable panels)", carrying the selected-
 * range totals of §12 (count, sum, min, max, avg) and the streaming progress
 * indicator of §4.4 ("a progress indicator in the status bar shows loaded versus
 * estimated total").
 *
 * Panels are components with `element()` and `refresh()`, registered by name, so
 * a host adds its own the same way the built-ins are added.
 */





/**
 * Reduce a value list to the five statistics §12 puts on the status bar.
 * Non-numeric values are counted but not summed, so a mixed range still reports
 * a truthful count rather than `NaN` everywhere.
 * @param {Iterable<unknown>} values the values in the selected range
 * @returns {{count: number, numericCount: number, sum: number|null, min: number|null, max: number|null, avg: number|null}} the statistics
 */
