    // Both default on. A read-only grid turns the cell menu off — it offers
    // Paste, Clear and Fill down, which have no business on a grid that cannot
    // be edited — while usually keeping the header menu, since sorting and
    // filtering are reading operations. A single column may still declare its
    // own menu on such a grid: the more specific level wins.
